      "message": "This could be a part of the baseActionSanitizer? A helper method that merge_cmds. You could basically add `baseCCActionSanitizer` that inherits from the `baseActionSanitizer`. This class would have a different implementation of `get_cmd()` where it will always return the merged commands of `super.get_cmd()`.\n\nThen have all of the `cc_genrule` inherit from the `baseCCActionSanitizer`. This would guarantee that we continue down the OO path.\n\nA simple example of what I think would be better.\n\n```\nclass baseCCActionSanitizer(baseActionSanitizer):\n      def get_cmd():\n          return merge_cmd(super.get_cmd())\n```",
